{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2023-05-04 12:05:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE EQUIFAX BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.39 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE\xa015, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 25,\xa02023. EQUIFAX HAS PAID CASH DIVIDENDS FOR MORE THAN 100 CONSECUTIVE YEARS.'}